 come from only 8 tagged females.\",\"The report's own per-female table demonstrates the clustering: B-07 is 0/3, while five other females are perfect (e.g., B-04 4/4), so trips within a female are not exchangeable independent Bernoulli draws.\",\"The significance verdict (p = 0.022656 < 0.05) depends on the inflated n of 24 pooled trips rather than the 8 independent units, so the issue is demonstrated in the selected report.\",\"No authority lock was minted, so lock_follows_declaration is not-applicable-no-lock.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":"not-applicable-no-lock","reasons":["Declaration consistent: data/input.csv contains exactly eight bee_tag values (B-01..B-08), each with 2-4 rows, matching the declared independent-unit column bee_tag and the stated one-row-per-trip structure.","The selected result pools all 24 trips into a single scipy.stats.binomtest with n = 24, a procedure that assumes each row is an independent trial, even though the report itself states the 24 trips come from only 8 tagged females.","The report's own per-female table demonstrates the clustering: B-07 is 0/3, while five other females are perfect (e.g., B-04 4/4), so trips within a female are not exchangeable independent Bernoulli draws.","The significance verdict (p = 0.022656 < 0.05) depends on the inflated n of 24 pooled trips rather than the 8 independent units, so the issue is demonstrated in the selected report.","No authority lock was minted, so lock_follows_declaration is not-applicable-no-lock."]},"ttft_ms":6000,"ttft_stream_ms":1512,"time_to_request_ms":10,"type":"result","duration_ms":17057,"uuid":"f0b6fc07-4b45-4d2f-887c-c7c07ff30872"}
